Searching for wireless handheld microphone rental in Malaga, Spain, usually means a speaker who has to move: a host walking the stage, a panel that passes questions along, a speech at a wedding, a presenter at a product launch. This page explains the handheld microphones we actually own, which packages include one, how many an event needs and what we source when you need something different.

Malaga Event Gear (MEG) owns six wireless handheld microphones and delivers, installs and tests them with a sound system across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol. They are one part of our [audiovisual equipment rental service](/blog/audiovisual-equipment-rental-service/), where you can see the rest of the range.

