## Brief Overview

---

Malaga Event Gear owns six wireless handheld microphones, all Audix: three OM5 and one OM2 from the Fusion Series, and two RAD-360 sets. The [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) and the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) each include one, and the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) lists wireless microphones for speeches and announcements. Extra handhelds are quoted as an add on, and more than six means suppliers.

## Key Highlights

---

-   Six wireless handheld microphones in our own inventory: three Audix OM5, one Audix OM2 and two Audix RAD-360 sets.
-   The Product Presentation Pack and the MICE Pack each include one premium wireless handheld microphone. The Wedding Pack lists professional wireless microphones for speeches and announcements, without a count.
-   The Eco Pack includes one wired dynamic microphone, not a wireless one.
-   Extra handhelds have no published price and are quoted as an add on. More than six are not in our own inventory, so we look at suppliers, if there is one.
-   Our technician operates the sound and the microphones. The speaker runs their own slides.

-   **Who sets it up and tests it?** Our crew delivers, installs and tests it with the sound system. We work delivery only, with no self pickup.
-   **Who sets the levels during the event?** A technician, if your package includes one or you add one. Otherwise the levels stay as set.
-   **What is not in our own inventory?** A handheld of another brand and more than six handhelds. A headset or lavalier set is ours, but no package includes one.

## Our Six Wireless Handheld Microphones

Our wireless handhelds are four Audix microphones from the Fusion Series, three OM5 and one OM2, and two Audix RAD-360 sets. Each RAD-360 set comes with its receiver, a handheld microphone and two antennas. A wireless handheld is a microphone the speaker holds, with no cable to the sound system, so the speaker can walk the stage or the room while the sound stays on the mixing console.

<InlineCTA />

We do not publish a technical sheet for them. No battery life, range, frequency band or number of channels, and no claim about how many can run at once in the same room. If one of those matters for your event, tell us and we say plainly what we can and cannot offer.

## Which Package Includes a Wireless Handheld Microphone

Three of our packages mention a wireless microphone, and a fourth gives a wired one.

-   The [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/), at 310 euros ex VAT, includes one premium wireless handheld microphone for speakers, with a 5000 lumen projector, a front projection screen and a venue sound system with 2 speakers and a mixing console. It has no technician on site, so the speaker runs it after our crew sets it up.
-   The [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/), at 490 euros ex VAT, includes one gooseneck plus one wireless handheld microphone, a 60 inch LED display and a technician on site for up to 6 hours, for up to 120 guests.
-   The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/), at 650 euros ex VAT, lists professional wireless microphones for speeches and announcements and an on site technician who operates the sound and the microphones, for up to 80 guests. The list gives no count and no model.
-   The [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) includes one wired dynamic microphone. The [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) includes one gooseneck microphone and no wireless handheld.

Our packages do not say which of the six handhelds goes with which pack. If you need a second handheld, a handheld on a pack that does not list one, or more than one for a panel, it is an add on by quote.

## Handheld, Lectern or Hands Free: Which Microphone Fits?

The microphone follows how the speaker moves. A wireless handheld suits a speaker who walks away from a fixed spot: a host at the front of a stage, a moderator who carries the microphone to whoever asks a question, a wedding speech from the floor. A gooseneck microphone suits a speaker who stays in one place, so our guide to [lectern rental](/blog/lectern-rental/) covers the lectern a gooseneck sits on. If the speaker walks a stage, our guide to [stage platform rental](/blog/stage-platform-rental/) covers the platforms we own.

A speaker who needs both hands free is a third case. We also own wireless lavalier sets and a headband microphone, as a separate item that none of our packages includes. Tell us who needs which and we quote the mix.

## How Many Handheld Microphones an Event Needs

Count the people who speak at the same time, not the people who speak in total. A single host and a moderator can share one handheld, passing it along. A panel of several people talking in turns or a debate with a floor microphone needs more, and passing one microphone around is slower and noisier than giving each person their own.

We do not publish how many wireless handhelds can run together in one room, and the answer depends on the venue and the wireless equipment. Tell us your format, the number of speakers and the venue, and we quote the microphones together with the package.

## Who Sets the Levels, and Is a Technician Included?

Our crew delivers, installs and tests the microphones with the sound system before your event starts, setting the level of each one on the mixing console. A level set for the room helps keep feedback under control, and our guide to [audio system calibration](/blog/audio-system-calibration/) explains how the levels are set.

During the event, who touches the console depends on the package. The MICE Pack includes a technician on site for up to 6 hours, who operates the sound and the microphones and solves any fault with the sound or the screen. An extra hour is 40 euros. The Wedding Pack includes a technician too. On the Product Presentation Pack there is no technician, so the levels stay as set. The speaker always runs their own slides.

## How Much Does a Wireless Handheld Microphone Rental Cost?

The cost has three parts. The package comes first: 310 euros ex VAT for the Product Presentation Pack, 490 euros ex VAT for the MICE Pack or 650 euros ex VAT for the Wedding Pack, with transport and setup included and 21 percent Spanish VAT added on top. The technician comes second: included on the MICE Pack and the Wedding Pack, not on the Product Presentation Pack. The extra handhelds come third.

We publish no price for a handheld on its own and no daily or weekly rate, so we will not guess a figure here. Tell us your event and we quote the package, the extra microphones and the technician together.

## How to Choose a Wireless Handheld Microphone Rental

Whoever you hire, these five questions are worth asking. Here are our answers:

-   **Who owns the microphones?** Six Audix wireless handhelds are ours. Anything beyond them, or a different brand, is sourced from suppliers, and we tell you so.
-   **Is it wireless or wired?** The Eco Pack microphone is wired. The handhelds on the other packs are wireless.
-   **Who sets the levels?** Our crew sets them at installation. A technician during the event is included in the MICE Pack and the Wedding Pack.
-   **How many can run at once?** We do not publish a number. Ask whoever you hire, and give them your venue.
-   **How does it arrive?** We work delivery only, with no self pickup, and every booking needs at least 24 hours of notice.

