## Where We Deliver and How to Book

Searching for a rental near you matters less than whether the equipment reaches your venue. We are based in Malaga and deliver across the Costa del Sol: Marbella, Fuengirola, Torremolinos, Benalmadena, Estepona, Mijas, Ronda and Nerja are all in our service area, and we also serve Sevilla with no minimum order. Granada needs a booking over 400 euros to cover the single day travel.

We work delivery only, with no self pickup, so nobody collects a microphone from us. Every booking needs at least 24 hours of notice, and booking as soon as your date is set leaves you the most choice. [Contact us](/contact/) with your venue, your date and how many people will speak.

## Conclusion

Wireless handheld microphone rental in Malaga means six Audix handhelds of our own: one in the Product Presentation Pack, one in the MICE Pack, wireless microphones listed in the Wedding Pack, more by quote, and suppliers beyond six. A different brand is outside our own inventory, and we say so before you book. [Contact us](/contact/) with your event details, or see the wider range on our [audiovisual equipment rental service](/blog/audiovisual-equipment-rental-service/) page.

## FAQs

### Can I rent a wireless handheld microphone on its own?

We quote it as a separate item. We publish no price for a handheld on its own, so we will not guess a figure. Tell us the event, the date and the venue, and we quote the microphone together with the sound it needs. We work delivery only, with no self pickup.

### How many wireless handheld microphones can I rent?

Six wireless handhelds are in our own inventory: three Audix OM5, one OM2 and two RAD-360 sets. If your event needs more than six, they are not in our own inventory, so tell us how many and we look for a solution with our suppliers, if there is one. We do not publish how many can run at once in the same room, and we do not promise availability or a price until we have checked.

### What does a microphone rental include?

With us, our crew delivers, installs and tests the microphone with the sound system before your event. A microphone has to connect to a sound system, so we quote it together with the sound it needs. What else comes with it depends on the package: the MICE Pack and the Wedding Pack include a technician on site, the Product Presentation Pack does not. We work delivery only, so nobody collects the equipment from us.

### Which packages include a wireless handheld microphone?

The [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) and the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) each include one premium wireless handheld microphone. The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) lists professional wireless microphones for speeches and announcements, without a count. The [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) includes a wired dynamic microphone and the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) a gooseneck microphone, so neither includes a wireless handheld.

### Do you rent Shure or Sennheiser microphones?

Our wireless handhelds are Audix models. A Shure or Sennheiser wireless handheld is not in our own inventory. Tell us what you need and we look for a solution with our suppliers, if there is one. We do not promise availability or a price until we have checked. Our guide to [audio visual rental for corporate meetings](/blog/audio-visual-rental-for-corporate-meetings/) explains what a meeting usually needs around the microphone.

### Is a technician included with the microphone?

It depends on the package. The [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) includes a technician on site for up to 6 hours, who operates the sound and the microphones. The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) includes one too. The [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) does not. The technician runs the sound, not the slides, so the speaker controls what is shown on the screen.
